{"no":104,"name":"سُورَةُ الهُمَزَةِ","enName":"Al-Humaza","enNameTranslation":"The Traducer","bnNameTranslation":"আল হুমাযা","revelationType":"Meccan","revelationOrder":32,"numberOfAyahs":9,"verses":[{"totalNumber":6180,"numberInSurah":1,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"وَيْلٌ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍ لُّمَزَةٍ","enText":"Woe to every scorner and mocker","enTextTransliteration":"Wai lul-li kulli hu mazatil-lumaza","bnText":"প্রত্যেক পশ্চাতে ও সম্মুখে পরনিন্দাকারীর দুর্ভোগ","bntextLatin":"Pratyeka pascate o sam'mukhe paranindakarira durbhoga"}},{"totalNumber":6181,"numberInSurah":2,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"الَّذِي جَمَعَ مَالًا وَعَدَّدَهُ","enText":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it.","enTextTransliteration":"Al-lazi jama'a maalaw wa'addadah","bnText":"যে অর্থ সঞ্চিত করে ও গণনা করে","bntextLatin":"Ye artha sancita kare o ganana kare"}},{"totalNumber":6182,"numberInSurah":3,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"يَحْسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُ أَخْلَدَهُ","enText":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal.","enTextTransliteration":"Yahsabu anna maalahu akhladah","bnText":"সে মনে করে যে, তার অর্থ চিরকাল তার সাথে থাকবে","bntextLatin":"se mane kare ye, tara artha cirakala tara sathe thakabe"}},{"totalNumber":6183,"numberInSurah":4,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"كَلَّا ۖ لَيُنبَذَنَّ فِي الْحُطَمَةِ","enText":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher.","enTextTransliteration":"Kalla layum ba zanna fil hutamah","bnText":"কখনও না, সে অবশ্যই নিক্ষিপ্ত হবে পিষ্টকারীর মধ্যে।","bntextLatin":"kakhana'o na, se abasya'i niksipta habe pistakarira madhye."}},{"totalNumber":6184,"numberInSurah":5,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"وَمَا أَدْرَاكَ مَا الْحُطَمَةُ","enText":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher?","enTextTransliteration":"Wa maa adraaka mal-hutamah","bnText":"আপনি কি জানেন, পিষ্টকারী কি","bntextLatin":"Apani ki janena, pistakari ki"}},{"totalNumber":6185,"numberInSurah":6,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"نَارُ اللَّهِ الْمُوقَدَةُ","enText":"It is the fire of Allah, [eternally] fueled,","enTextTransliteration":"Narul laahil-mooqada","bnText":"এটা আল্লাহর প্রজ্জ্বলিত অগ্নি","bntextLatin":"eta allahara prajjbalita agni"}},{"totalNumber":6186,"numberInSurah":7,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"الَّتِي تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى الْأَفْئِدَةِ","enText":"Which mounts directed at the hearts.","enTextTransliteration":"Al latee tat tali'u 'alalafidah","bnText":"যা হৃদয় পর্যন্ত পৌছবে।","bntextLatin":"ya hrdaya paryanta pauchabe."}},{"totalNumber":6187,"numberInSurah":8,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"إِنَّهَا عَلَيْهِم مُّؤْصَدَةٌ","enText":"Indeed, Hellfire will be closed down upon them","enTextTransliteration":"Innaha 'alaihim moosada","bnText":"এতে তাদেরকে বেঁধে দেয়া হবে","bntextLatin":"Ete taderake bemdhe deya habe"}},{"totalNumber":6188,"numberInSurah":9,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"فِي عَمَدٍ مُّمَدَّدَةٍ","enText":"In extended columns.","enTextTransliteration":"Fee 'amadim-mu mad dadah","bnText":"লম্বা লম্বা খুঁটিতে।","bntextLatin":"lamba lamba khumtite."}}]}